{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Catch\/share()"},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO5CatchV","role":"symbol","extendedModule":"_Concurrency","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"share()","conformance":{"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113"}},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Catch"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncsequences\/catch\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":